  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Optionally set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> to be applied during mapping.",
      "translation": "可选地设置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a>，以便在映射期间应用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Use this method if <a href=\"#configurePropertyConversions(java.util.function.Consumer)\"><code>configurePropertyConversions(Consumer)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#registerPropertyValueConverterFactory(org.springframework.data.convert.PropertyValueConverterFactory)\"><code>registerPropertyValueConverterFactory(PropertyValueConverterFactory)</code></a> are not sufficient.",
      "translation": "如果 <a href=\"#configurePropertyConversions(java.util.function.Consumer)\"><code>configurePropertyConversions(Consumer)</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"#registerPropertyValueConverterFactory(org.springframework.data.convert.PropertyValueConverterFactory)\"><code>registerPropertyValueConverterFactory(PropertyValueConverterFactory)</code></a> 不足以解决问题，请使用此方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use SpringData <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Jsr310 converters</code></a> for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/Jsr310Converters.LocalDateToDateConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>LocalDate</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/Jsr310Converters.LocalTimeToDateConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>LocalTime</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/Jsr310Converters.LocalDateTimeToDateConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>LocalDateTime</code></a> using the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html#systemDefault()\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId.systemDefault()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 Spring Data 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Jsr310 converters</code></a> 来处理\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/Jsr310Converters.LocalDateToDateConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>LocalDate</code></a>、\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/Jsr310Converters.LocalTimeToDateConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>LocalTime</code></a> 和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/Jsr310Converters.LocalDateTimeToDateConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>LocalDateTime</code></a>，并采用\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneId.html#systemDefault()\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneId.systemDefault()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the native MongoDB Java Driver <code>codes</code> for\n<code>LocalDate</code>, <code>LocalTime</code>\nand <code>LocalDateTime</code> using a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneOffset.html#UTC\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneOffset.UTC</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用原生 MongoDB Java Driver 的 <code>codes</code> 来处理<code>LocalDate</code>、<code>LocalTime</code>和<code>LocalDateTime</code>，并采用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneOffset.html#UTC\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneOffset.UTC</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set whether to or not to use the native MongoDB Java Driver <code>codes</code> for\n<code>LocalDate</code>, <code>LocalTime</code>\nand <code>LocalDateTime</code> using a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneOffset.html#UTC\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneOffset.UTC</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置是否使用原生 MongoDB Java Driver 的 <code>codes</code>，以配合 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/ZoneOffset.html#UTC\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>ZoneOffset.UTC</code></a> 处理 <code>LocalDate</code>、<code>LocalTime</code> 和 <code>LocalDateTime</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom/default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> implementation used to serve\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "添加一个自定义或默认的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> 实现，用于提供\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> using the provided <code>converters</code> and our own codecs for\nJSR-310 types.",
      "translation": "使用提供的<code>converters</code>以及我们自己的 JSR-310 类型编解码器，创建一个<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> implementation.",
      "translation": "添加自定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>Converter</code></a> 实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterFactory</code></a> implementation.",
      "translation": "添加自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>ConverterFactory</code></a> 实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Gateway to register property specific converters.",
      "translation": "注册特定于属性的转换器网关。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>converterFactory</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>converterFactory</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>valueConversions</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>valueConversions</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 2
