    {
      "source": "Configures the representation to for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigDecimal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigDecimal</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigInteger.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigInteger</code></a> values in\nMongoDB. Defaults to <a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.html#DECIMAL128\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.DECIMAL128</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置 MongoDB 中 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigDecimal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigDecimal</code></a>` 和 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigInteger.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigInteger</code></a>` 值的表示形式。默认值为 `<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.html#DECIMAL128\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.DECIMAL128</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> encapsulates creation of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration</code></a> with MongoDB specifics.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> 封装了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration</code></a> 的创建过程，并针对 MongoDB 进行了适配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures the representation to for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigDecimal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigDecimal</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigInteger.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigInteger</code></a> values in\nMongoDB.",
      "translation": "配置 MongoDB 中 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigDecimal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigDecimal</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigInteger.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigInteger</code></a> 值的表示方式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
